Carmen Cruickshank: I want to say every month, but I think every two weeks would actually might be better.

00:32:42.000 --> 00:32:44.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah.

00:32:43.000 --> 00:32:58.000
Carmen Cruickshank: like, I might even… I feel like every week is kind of annoying if I'm in their DM, like, every week, but I think every other week, and maybe every month, I could even email them if they're not getting back to my DM, like, hey, how are things going? You know, sending some stuff in the bowl.

00:32:47.000 --> 00:32:48.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:32:57.000 --> 00:32:58.000
Whitney Hodges: Right.

00:32:58.000 --> 00:33:15.000
Carmen Cruickshank: something like that. Uh, and from now on, when I don't… like, tomorrow, I might not get anybody for office hours, but if I see by, like, 1215, I don't have anybody, I'll probably just go account to account, and then just tag everybody, like, here's my thoughts on yours, and then maybe just DM them after, like, oh, hey, like, here's this.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:33:11.000 --> 00:33:13.000
Whitney Hodges: Love that.

00:33:16.000 --> 00:33:17.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:33:16.000 --> 00:33:24.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So, yeah, I think those are ways I could be, like, more engaged. And I think when people see that, then they're like, oh, okay, I'm gonna check this, check that, you know? So, yeah.

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:32.000
Whitney Hodges: Right. Yeah. So, would it be helpful if there's, like, I don't know, like a…

