Whitney Hodges: Yeah, no, I think that that sounds good. So I'm thinking that maybe there just need to be, like, notes within that, um…

00:34:16.000 --> 00:34:33.000
Whitney Hodges: weekly office hours, click up task of something like maybe even you're like noting in the task of like attendance like this is who was there. And then you're saying, okay, these people weren't in attendance. So this is who I DM'd and.

00:34:33.000 --> 00:34:36.000
Whitney Hodges: These people haven't been in attendance in, like.

00:34:36.000 --> 00:34:44.000
Whitney Hodges: three weeks, so this is who I emailed, sort of thing. Something like that. Maybe it's, like, subtasks within the…

00:34:43.000 --> 00:34:44.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:34:44.000 --> 00:34:47.000
Whitney Hodges: Office hours task? Like, would that make sense?

00:34:44.000 --> 00:34:46.000
Carmen Cruickshank: The task.

00:34:47.000 --> 00:34:58.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, I think that makes sense, because, like, that's… if I'm putting my time in there, then that's just where I'm checking for, like, this and that. And I think as clients continue to grow, I just want to have, like, one set place that I see that, so yeah.

00:34:53.000 --> 00:34:54.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:34:58.000 --> 00:35:04.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, perfect. Then I'll get with Giselle on that, and we'll put that in place.

