Carmen Cruickshank: Uh-huh.

00:35:16.000 --> 00:35:29.000
Whitney Hodges: 30-day, 60-day, 90-day check-ins sort of thing. And I don't know that we would necessarily want to do 90 days, because 90 days is, like, right at the, like, the end of the time in their vault, but…

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:29.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:42.000
Whitney Hodges: like, I wonder if, you know, outside of office hours, if, you know, 30 days after the VIP day, you're almost, like, going in and doing a dedicated, like, short.

