Whitney Hodges: 5-minute recording, right, for that client who's…

00:35:46.000 --> 00:36:00.000
Whitney Hodges: VIP day was 30 days ago, and then kind of doing the same thing in 60 days, and we could still post it, like, in the general discussion channel, and just tag them, um, but then that way… I don't know.

00:35:56.000 --> 00:35:57.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mmhm.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mmhm.

00:36:01.000 --> 00:36:05.000
Whitney Hodges: I know it kind of increases the deliverables, but…

00:36:05.000 --> 00:36:08.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Like, keeps it more engaged.

00:36:05.000 --> 00:36:09.000
Whitney Hodges: I think we would approve, you know?

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:18.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, because I think if we're putting that there's, like, a community, then it's like, oh, like, here's the value we have from actually having the community, versus just expecting them to just post.

00:36:18.000 --> 00:36:30.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So, yeah, I think for now, just, like, increasing the deliverables, like, just seeing what works and what people respond to, I think that's better than just, like, adding one or two deliverables and saying that that's doing more when, like, people don't feel a difference.

00:36:18.000 --> 00:36:20.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:36:26.000 --> 00:36:27.000
Whitney Hodges: Give me one second.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:32.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:41.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So, yeah, I definitely think that's good, though, to add. And then I gotta also keep track, like, after I finish a VIP day, almost, like, put it on my calendar, like, here's the 30-day mark, like, send.

00:36:40.000 --> 00:36:58.000
Whitney Hodges: Right. Yeah. And we would set that up within ClickUp. Like, I would have Giselle come up with a way for that to to happen automatically, so that it's not like you're trying to, like, mentally track all of that, like, get it all on your on your calendar.

00:36:53.000 --> 00:36:55.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Weird.

