00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:18.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mmhm.

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:34.000
Whitney Hodges: like, I feel like it has the potential to turn into a community, um, but at this point, I wouldn't call it that, you know what I mean? Um, and so I feel like that.

00:37:32.000 --> 00:37:33.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

