Whitney Hodges: with Laura especially, is what kind of created a misaligned expectation. Like, I think that she came in expecting to find community and a lot of other, like, business owners who were, like, engaged and, like, stuff going on in the discussion. Um, Krista, if you remember Krista, she kind of said the same thing.

